    <pre class="code sig" data-lang="ts"><code><span class="tok-keyword">export</span> <span class="tok-keyword">function</span> <span class="tok-fn"><a class="type-ref" href="#symbol-brew">brew</a></span>(x: string): <span class="tok-keyword">void</span> {}</code></pre><p>Brew it &quot;with quotes&quot; &lt;script&gt;alert(1)&lt;/script&gt;.</p><div class="params"><h4>Parameters</h4><table>
